		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Animate furnace. Urn-shaped copper golem with a gaping mouth. Its interior is filled with searing coals.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +6 (2d6 + swallow), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Golem</strong>. Immune to damage from non-magical sources. Healed by fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Swallow</strong>. On a bite attack roll of 19-20, target is swallowed. Total darkness inside and 2d10 damage per round. Tophet regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 10 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
